  "correctValue": "6",
  "solution": {
    "text": "The frequency of optical communication is given by,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mfrac></math>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1200</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>13</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></math><br /><br />But only <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>%</mo></math> of the source frequency is available for TV transmission.<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8242;</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.5</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>14</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8242;</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.5</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>14</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>100</mn></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8242;</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>12</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>Hz</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;&#160;&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8242;</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal